  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "2. Add onion and garlic; cook until softened, 5 minutes.",
    "3. Add stew mix and cook, stirring constantly, 1 minute.",
    "4. Add broth and bring to a boil.",
    "5. Add chicken and return to a boil.",
    "6. Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, 20 minutes or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "7. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "8. Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
